All that you need to know about Web Hackathon
Tech Zephyr 4.0 — Web Hackathon:

Welcome to Tech Zephyr 4.0 — Web Hackathon, an exciting competitive event organized by IIT Bhubaneswar.
This isn't your typical hackathon. Participants will be challenged to design, develop, and deploy a complete website while working under strict time constraints. From creating an engaging user experience to implementing functional backend systems, participants will need to combine creativity, problem-solving, and technical skills to build a complete working product.
